		<releaseNotes>In this release we made the following updates:

• Added support for completing in-session WebAuthn challenges by using local passwordless credentials.
• Added external identity support.
• Updated the UX to replace &quot;Frontline&quot; with &quot;Flex Shared&quot; and &quot;Frontline Shared&quot; with &quot;Flex Dedicated&quot;.
• Addressed Cloud PC tile status not updating automatically (or promptly) after a state change.
• Fixed an issue where remote audio stopped rendering when connecting to Windows 7 PCs.
• Resolved a black screen encountered when connecting to an invalid resource while another RemoteApp session was active.
• Made updates to improve Continuous Access Evaluation (CAE) scenarios for AVD and Windows 365.
• Prevented hardware keyboard focus from being captured when the app is inactive in Stage Manager and Split View.
• Fixed Add Workspace incorrectly preventing users from adding the same AVD or Windows 365 feed with another account.

In addition, we've also made numerous behind-the-scenes updates to improve performance and stability, and to lay the groundwork for some upcoming features.

If you encounter any errors, you can contact us via Settings &gt; Submit Feedback.</releaseNotes>
